  <section class="section sec-tight-top" id="faq">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="split-head">
        <h2>Questions before you write</h2>
        <p>Short answers to what clients usually ask first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How do I get a price?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></summary>
          <p>Send me a short message about what you need. I reply with questions if something is unclear, then send a written estimate with the scope and the price. Nothing starts before you agree to it.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>How long will my project take?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></summary>
          <p>It depends on the size of the project, so I give the timeline in the written estimate instead of guessing in advance.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Can I see a project you have built?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></summary>
          <p>Yes. Geetva Enterprise, a precision brass and metal manufacturer in Jamnagar, is live in production. <a href="/work/geetva/">Read the case study</a>.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>Will my website work on a phone?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></summary>
          <p>Yes. Every website I build is designed for small screens first and checked on a phone before it goes live.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What do you need from me to start?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></summary>
          <p>A short description of your business and what the website or software should do. If you have a logo, photos, product details or examples you like, send them too. If you do not, we can work around it.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>I am not in Rajkot. Can we still work together?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></summary>
          <p>Yes. I work by email and calls, so your location does not limit the project.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>What happens after the site goes live?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></summary>
          <p>I stay available for updates and fixes. Ask me about ongoing support when you request the estimate.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
